# Children contents: objects removed from the model. The text of the object goes, with its separators.

=== remove the only concept of a unit
--- source
unit U {
	concept A {
	}
}
--- edit
remove A
--- expect
unit U {
}

=== remove the first concept
--- source
unit U {
	concept A {
	}
	concept B {
	}
	concept C {
	}
}
--- edit
remove A
--- expect
unit U {
	concept B {
	}
	concept C {
	}
}

