=== remove a method with its parameters
known-defect: P2PP-D-9
--- source
unit U {
	concept A {
		field x : int;
		method m(a : int, b : string);
	}
}
--- edit
remove A.m
--- expect
unit U {
	concept A {
		field x : int;
	}
}

