=== remove a member: its same-row comment goes with it, the comment on its own row stays
known-defect: P2PP-D-9
--- source
unit U {
	concept A {
		field x : int;
		// about y
		field y : int; // y
		field z : int;
	}
}
--- edit
remove A.y
--- expect
unit U {
	concept A {
		field x : int;
		// about y
		field z : int;
	}
}
